WEBVTT

00:39:59.858 --> 00:40:02.549
demanding attention and holding
forth in a conversation

00:40:02.573 --> 00:40:05.360
about a topic on which
they are relatively ill-informed."

00:40:05.384 --> 00:40:07.708
And you, Susan Cain,
are to blame for this.

00:40:07.732 --> 00:40:08.850
(Laughter)

00:40:08.874 --> 00:40:12.784
CA: Do you feel that extroverts
are the bad guys here

00:40:12.808 --> 00:40:16.749
and that your whole revolution
has been trying to put them down

00:40:16.773 --> 00:40:18.809
and raise the power of introversion?

00:40:18.833 --> 00:40:19.991
Or something else?

00:40:20.015 --> 00:40:21.172
SC: Oh, God, no.

00:40:21.196 --> 00:40:22.270
(Laughter)

00:40:22.294 --> 00:40:26.878
SC: I so don't feel that,
and I'm so aware of the danger

00:40:26.902 --> 00:40:30.129
that it could be and occasionally
is seen that way.